  "prefLabel": "Plc 906.03 Licensee Responsibilities for Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 906.03 Licensee Responsibilities for Renewal. Each licensee shall:\n\n(a) Know when the licensee’s license is due to expire; and\n\n(b) Except for holders of a temporary license, file an application for renewal prior to the expiration of the current license in accordance with Plc 907.04 if the licensee wishes to continue to practice in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
